  "summary": "As an experienced IT manager and senior lead engineer at Indusys Technology, Inc, I lead the development and support of internal IT systems for 60+ employees, overseeing company-wide intranet, video and VoIP systems across multiple office and lab locations. My expertise also includes building our front-end and back-end websites, creating automation tools for parts recommendations for our Onsite Repair Service, automating reports for customers, and integrating our systems with our customers via WebHooks and Rest APIs. With 11+ years in the industry and an MBA, I also lead teams of 30+ technicians on client projects, maintaining strong relationships with clients' engineers and executives.",
