      "totalDuration": "18 yrs 6 mos",
      "description": "As the IT manager, I am responsible for developing and maintaining company-wide IT infrastructure across multiple geographical location (California, Texas, and Tennessee) \n\nResponsibilities include:\n-Design and implement company VoIP network\n-Design, maintain, monitor and troubleshoot company network access and security\n-Provide hardware and software technical support to 70+ employees\n\nAs the Software Developer, I am responsible for:\n-Developing and maintaining our Company Front End and Back End Web Portal across multiple geographical locations (California, Texas, and Tennessee).\n-Creating an AI Automation tool to simplify the Shipping Process.\n-Creating Automation Tools to automate Work Order creation and reporting to our customers.\n-Creating an AI Tool to automate the Part Recommendation to support our Onsite Repair Services.\n-Integration our system with our customer's via WebHook and Rest API.",
      "insights": ""
     },
     {
      "title": "Senior Lead Engineer",
      "timePeriod": {
       "startDate": {
        "month": 5,
        "year": 2006
       },
       "endDate": null
      },
      "totalDuration": "20 yrs 7 mos",
      "description": "As the senior lead engineer, I manage 30 electronics hardware technicians to:\n\n- Assess technical specification of new products to provide accurate time as well as financial estimate for manufacturing process.\n- Perform and generate technical analysis as requested by customers.\n- Create technical documentation, test procedures and work flow processes.\n- Provide technical training to internal staffs.\n- Assist management to ensure seamless and productive production environment.\n- Define and streamline parts management process to internal staffs and customers",
      "insights": ""
     }
    ]
   }
